      "description": "A scene depicting a historical photograph of Adolf Hitler and a woman seated at a table, overlaid with hateful text that equates the Holocaust with cooking meat. The scene is designed to be offensive and dangerous, exploiting the visual of a historical figure to normalize and glorify genocide. The text 'do you like your juice cold?' followed by 'no, i like my jews well done.' directly links the visual of Hitler to antisemitic tropes.",
