      "instance_name": "nazi_germany",
      "label": "Nazi Germany",
      "description": "The totalitarian regime led by Adolf Hitler from 1933 to 1945, characterized by extreme nationalism, racial purity laws, and the persecution and genocide of Jews and other groups. The visual of Hitler in the image is directly tied to this regime, which is the historical context for the hateful text overlay. The meme uses the image of Hitler to evoke the atrocities committed by Nazi Germany.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
