      "description": "The text 'do you like your juice cold?' and 'no, i like my jews well done' is overlaid on the image of Adolf Hitler, mapping him as the entity who is speaking these hateful words. The visual of Hitler is used to represent the speaker of the antisemitic trope, directly linking his historical role in the Holocaust to the violent metaphor.",
