      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the antisemitic food metaphor",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the hateful text overlay, specifically the second line 'no, i like my jews well done', which uses a dehumanizing food metaphor to equate the Holocaust with cooking meat. This projection implies the user is identifying with or adopting the hateful perspective of the speaker (Adolf Hitler) in the meme, thereby internalizing the antisemitic trope. The deictic 'my' in 'my jews' directly projects the user's identity onto the speaker's violent and genocidal worldview.",
